  "bodyHash": "0228d33d700ca6fb",
  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"color:#339;font-size:12px\">\"Corail Woodcutter 僅是一個類似石頭切割機的木材配方鋸木廠，預設支援 Biomes O' Plenty、Twilight Forest、Quark 與 The Midnight。\"</span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#339;font-size:18px\">描述</span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"color:#339\">此模組提供了一座鋸木廠，運作方式類似石頭切割機，但專門處理木板與原木。<br></span><span style=\"color:#339\">預設情況下，鋸木廠有 6 種模型（對應原版每種木板變體），並會自動適應您的資源包。<br></span><span style=\"color:#339\">它同時也為 Biomes O' Plenty 與 The Midnight 提供了鋸木廠變體與所有配方的支援。</span><span style=\"color:#339\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#339\">村莊中也可能包含此鋸木廠。<br>若您在設定檔中允許（預設為開啟），您也可以透過蹲下直接從物品欄中使用它。<br>如需 Synthestra 製作的更具 Minecraft 風格的材質包，請點擊此連結： <span style=\"color:#f90\"><a style=\"color:#f90\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/corail-woodcutter-mixel-fix\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a></span><br>註：對「Oh the Biomes You'll Go」的支援已獨立為另一個專案： <span style=\"color:#f90\"><a style=\"color:#f90\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/corail-woodcutter-extension\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a><br></span></span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#339\">資料包</span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#339\">指令 /cwc（或 /woodcutter）可讓您</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#339\">&nbsp;使用此模組，並「產生」一份以鋸木廠格式編排的木製合成配方資料包。<br></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#339\">產生後，它們會先以 zip 壓縮檔的形式出現在設定檔資料夾中。接著，您可以「套用」該資料包以在遊戲內獲得這些配方。<br></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#339\">此指令同樣適用於專用伺服器。<br></span><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#339\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">/cwc datapack [generate|apply|remove] [modid]</span><br><br></span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#339\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/347/323/sawmill-model.jpg\" alt=\"Corail Woodcutter 中的鋸木廠模型\" width=\"394\" height=\"220\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/347/324/biomeoplenty-sawmill.jpg\" alt=\"Biomes O&#x27;Plenty 的鋸木廠\" width=\"418\" height=\"220\"></span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"color:#339;font-size:18px\">配方格式<br></span></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/433/309/recipe_format.jpg\" alt=\"Corail Woodcutter：配方格式\" width=\"385\" height=\"288\"><br>1.20.4 條件式配方格式<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/790/792/recipe_format_1.png\" alt=\"1.20.4 條件式配方格式\" width=\"600\" height=\"402\"><br>{<br> \"type\": \"corail_woodcutter:woodcutting\",<br> \"ingredient\": {<br> \"item\": \"biomesoplenty:cherry_log\"<br> },<br> \"result\": \"corail_pillar:pillar_cherry_log\",<br> \"count\": 2,<br> \"conditions\": [<br> {<br> \"type\": \"forge:mod_loaded\",<br> \"modid\": \"corail_woodcutter\"<br> },{<br> \"type\": \"forge:mod_loaded\",<br> \"modid\": \"biomesoplenty\"<br> }<br> ]<br>}</div>\n<p><span style=\"color:#339\">註：這些配方當然也可以使用 CraftTweaker 進行編輯。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#339\"><strong>JEI 中顯示鋸木廠配方的自訂分類</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/347/325/corail-woodcutter-jei.jpg\" alt=\"Corail Woodcutter：JEI 支援\" width=\"336\" height=\"200\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/347/326/woodcutter-crafting-recipe.jpg\" alt=\"Corail Woodcutter 配方\" width=\"311\" height=\"160\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#339\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/347/327/corail-woodcutter-gui01.jpg\" alt=\"Corail Woodcutter 介面畫面\" width=\"412\" height=\"230\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/347/328/corail-woodcutter-gui02.jpg\" alt=\"Corail Woodcutter 合成畫面\" width=\"412\" height=\"230\"></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
